[[624,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the gear lever boot.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017282.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[624,127,0,"<p>1. Remove the gear lever grip (1a) with the tool (1b) positioned\nas illustrated in the diagram and undo the bolt until it is completely\nremoved.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Protect the contact areas between\nthe gear lever knob and the tool to prevent superficial damage using\nfelt, bodywork tape, etc.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.668.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the spring.</p><p>3. Remove the reverse gear inhibitor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017283.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[624,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the reverse gear inhibitor (1a) and spring (1b) back in\nthe housing.</p><p>2. Place the gear lever knob (2a) back in its housing using the\ntool (2b) positioned as illustrated in the diagram and adjust the\nbolt until the fitting is completed.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.668.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[624,127,0,"<p>Place the gear lever boot back in its housing.</p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Remove the spring.</p><p>2. Remove the reverse gear inhibitor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069738.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the reverse gear inhibitor back in\nits housing.</p><p>Place the spring back in its housing.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Remove the spring.</p><p>2. Remove the reverse gear inhibitor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069867.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the reverse gear inhibitor back in\nits housing.</p><p>Place the spring back in its housing.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]